Package: itnb
Type: Package
Title: Inflated And Truncated Negative Binomial Regression
Version: 0.2
Date: 2024-10-04
Authors@R: person(given = c("Søren", "B."), family = "Vilsen", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "svilsen@mp.aau.dk") 
Description: Fits inflated and truncated negative binomial regression models with parameter estimation via the EM or MLE; confidence envelopes and hypothesis testing are supported through parametric or non-parametric bootstrap.
